# Frontend Conventions

## Stack

- **Vite** + **React 19** + **TypeScript** (strict — no `any` unless unavoidable)
- **Tailwind CSS 4** for styling
- **shadcn/ui + Radix UI** for UI primitives (use these before building custom components)
- **react-router** for pages in `web/src/pages/`
- English copy only (no i18n)

## File Layout

```
web/src/
  pages/                  # Route pages
  components/             # Shared React components
    ui/                   # shadcn/Radix primitives (don't modify directly)
  lib/                    # utils, API client
  hooks/                  # Custom hooks
```

## API Calls

The UI is served from the gateway. Call `/api/...` on the same origin (Vite dev proxies `/api` to `http://127.0.0.1:6317`). Do not hardcode `localhost:6317` in components.

## Auth

There is **no login page**. Do not add AuthContext, UserInfo, or `/login`.
